NOTICE — castctl

This file records the upstream works that castctl is built from, links
against, or studied. It lists attribution and license names only. How
each item maps to the castctl tree, with file and line references on
both sides, is recorded in docs/provenance.md, which is the detailed
record; this file is the summary. When porting new behavior from an
upstream, update docs/provenance.md and this file in the same PR
(see AGENTS.md, rule 6).

Scope boundary: section (b) lists load-bearing linked dependencies
only. It is not a complete inventory of every transitive module in
go.mod/go.sum or every package in webui/bun.lock. A complete,
tool-generated license inventory is the release PR's scope. The
licenses of the npm packages bundled into webui/dist/index.html were
not checked for this file; that gap is recorded in
docs/provenance.md.

